1
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,279
What's up, Tawan?

2
00:00:21,279 --> 00:00:24,375
Hey, where are you?
Why is there music?

3
00:00:24,375 --> 00:00:27,690
I'm at P'Gun's friend's bar.

4
00:00:30,412 --> 00:00:33,766
So why did you call me?

5
00:00:33,766 --> 00:00:37,252
Nothing, just calling to
tell you I'm safe.

6
00:00:37,409 --> 00:00:39,345
I'm so relieved, man.

7
00:00:39,345 --> 00:00:41,765
So what's wrong with BB?

8
00:00:41,974 --> 00:00:45,320
Just gastritis.

9
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:50,320
See? You were panicking for nothing.

10
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:52,887
Dude, I was scared, okay?

11
00:00:53,166 --> 00:00:55,236
Then why didn't you use protection?

12
00:00:55,236 --> 00:00:59,437
We did, but sometimes, you know…
in the heat of the moment.

13
00:01:00,117 --> 00:01:05,385
You're lucky this time. If it happens again,
you won't be laughing.

14
00:01:07,549 --> 00:01:09,176
So who are you with right now?

15
00:01:10,589 --> 00:01:16,043
Uh… I'm with P'Gun.
Why? You coming?

16
00:01:16,846 --> 00:01:19,765
Yeah, I'll go. I'll call you when I'm there.

17
00:01:19,765 --> 00:01:23,622
Hey—Tawan? Hello?

18
00:01:25,629 --> 00:01:27,973
Who was that?

19
00:01:30,974 --> 00:01:34,325
Tawan.
Tawan?

20
00:01:34,325 --> 00:01:36,086
Why did he call?

21
00:01:37,866 --> 00:01:41,478
He called because he was scared
his girlfriend might be pregnant.

22
00:01:42,368 --> 00:01:45,713
And what does his girlfriend being pregnant
have to do with you?

23
00:01:46,428 --> 00:01:50,049
Well, I'm his friend.
When he has a problem, I have to help.

24
00:01:50,049 --> 00:01:51,507
Of course I help him.

25
00:01:51,507 --> 00:01:55,409
If P'Night got a girl pregnant,
would you help him?

26
00:01:56,320 --> 00:02:00,506
Night—
Remember this.

27
00:02:00,925 --> 00:02:05,129
Night would *never* get a woman pregnant. Ever.

28
00:02:08,119 --> 00:02:10,800
What's wrong with you?
